 14037	          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>条件</th><th>遷移先</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>POST 取込の完了（成功・失敗いずれも）</td><td><code>GET …/product/product_shelf_number_csv_import</code></td></tr><tr><td>ナビから開く</td><td><code>GET …/product/product_shelf_number_csv_import</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
